  "title": "Jo&#39;s Manicotti",
  "description": "Hearty tubes of manicotti are stuffed with a rich blend of ricotta and Romano cheeses, spinach, eggs, onion, garlic and thyme, drizzled with a simple tomato sauce, sprinkled with mozzarella and baked until bubbly.",
